  "description": "After being discharged from the military, Geonwoo returns to campus as an older returning student. In desperate need of a scholarship, the fourth-year finds himself stuck doing a campus mentoring program he never asked for... only to realize the pretty mentee he gets paired with looks strangely familiar...?\n\n*\"Suhyeon, you're as pretty as ever!\"  \n\"I know. You’ve always liked my face, hyung.\"  \n\"....(＃°Д°)\"*\n\n[Devoted top who only has eyes for his *hyung* X Clueless bottom who has no idea what's happening but is falling in love anyway] *(Source: MrBlue, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079857)",
